<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>TechFusion 2026</title>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>body{font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif}</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">

<nav class="flex justify-between items-center px-8 py-5 border-b border-slate-800">
  <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400">⚡ TechFusion</span>
  <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">12–14 September 2026</span>
</nav>

<header class="text-center px-6 py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-950 via-slate-950 to-slate-950">
  <p class="uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 text-sm mb-3">Annual Technical Festival</p>
  <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-4">TechFusion <span class="text-cyan-400">2026</span></h1>
  <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">Innovate. Compete. Celebrate technology — three days of hackathons, robotics, workshops, and live shows.</p>
  <a href="#register" class="bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-full transition">Register Now</a>
</header>

<section class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 px-8 py-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
  <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:border-cyan-500 transition">
    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤖</div>
    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Robotics Arena</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Build and battle bots for glory.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:border-cyan-500 transition">
    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">💻</div>
    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">24-Hr Hackathon</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Code non-stop, ship big ideas.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:border-cyan-500 transition">
    <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🎤</div>
    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Guest Talks</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Learn from industry experts.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="register" class="text-center px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-800">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-3">Seats Are Limited!</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6">Open to all students and faculty. Entry free with college ID.</p>
  <a href="#" class="bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-10 py-3 rounded-full transition">Get Your Pass</a>
</section>

<footer class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm py-6 border-t border-slate-800">
  Department of Technical Affairs &middot; contact@techfusion2026.edu
</footer>

</body>
</html>
